==Notes==
*Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
*This feat is usable once per [[day]].
*Spells or effects such as [[true seeing]] and [[ultravision]] do not "lift" the [[darkness]] for the character, rather it allows the character to target items and NPCs normally. The player can use the <code>Tab</code> key to "see" where enemies are when he/she has one of these effects active in darkness.

